{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type Hotkey = \n  | Key\n  | SingleModifierHotkey\n  | TwoModifierHotkey\n  | ThreeModifierHotkey\n  | FourModifierHotkey;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L126","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey.types.ts:126"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A type-safe hotkey string."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provides autocomplete for:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All single keys (letters, numbers, function keys, navigation, editing, punctuation)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Single modifier + common key (Control+S, Mod+A, Mod+/, etc.)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Two modifiers + common key (Mod+Shift+S, Control+Alt+A, etc.)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Three modifiers + common key (Control+Alt+Shift+A, Mod+Alt+Shift+S, etc.)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Four modifiers + common key (Control+Alt+Shift+Meta+A, etc.)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"modifier-names","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Modifier Names"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use canonical modifier names:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Control"},{"type":"text","value":" (not Ctrl) - The Control key"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Alt"},{"type":"text","value":" (not Option) - The Alt key (Option on macOS)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" (not Command/Cmd) - The Meta/Command key (macOS only)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Shift"},{"type":"text","value":" - The Shift key"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"platform-adaptive-mod-modifier","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Platform-Adaptive "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" Modifier"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" modifier is a special platform-adaptive modifier that automatically resolves\nto the \"primary modifier\" on each platform:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"macOS"}]},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" (Command key ⌘)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Windows/Linux"}]},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Control"},{"type":"text","value":" (Ctrl key)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This enables cross-platform hotkey definitions that work correctly on all platforms\nwithout platform-specific code. The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" modifier is resolved at runtime based on\nthe detected platform."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When to use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" vs platform-specific modifiers:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" for cross-platform shortcuts (e.g., "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+S"},{"type":"text","value":" for save)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Control"},{"type":"text","value":" when you need platform-specific behavior"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" when you want your shortcuts to follow platform conventions automatically"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Limitations:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Control"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" combinations are not allowed (they create duplicate\nmodifiers on one platform)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"In four-modifier combinations, only canonical modifiers are allowed (no "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// Cross-platform shortcuts (recommended)\nconst save: Hotkey = 'Mod+S'           // Command+S on Mac, Ctrl+S on Windows/Linux\nconst saveAs: Hotkey = 'Mod+Shift+S'   // Command+Shift+S on Mac, Ctrl+Shift+S elsewhere\nconst comment: Hotkey = 'Mod+/'       // Command+/ on Mac, Ctrl+/ elsewhere\n\n// Platform-specific shortcuts\nconst macOnly: Hotkey = 'Meta+S'       // Command+S on Mac only\nconst windowsOnly: Hotkey = 'Control+S' // Ctrl+S on Windows/Linux only","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"modifier-names","text":"Modifier Names","level":2},{"id":"platform-adaptive-mod-modifier","text":"Platform-Adaptive Mod Modifier","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype Hotkey = \n  | Key\n  | SingleModifierHotkey\n  | TwoModifierHotkey\n  | ThreeModifierHotkey\n  | FourModifierHotkey;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:126](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L126)\n\nA type-safe hotkey string.\n\nProvides autocomplete for:\n- All single keys (letters, numbers, function keys, navigation, editing, punctuation)\n- Single modifier + common key (Control+S, Mod+A, Mod+/, etc.)\n- Two modifiers + common key (Mod+Shift+S, Control+Alt+A, etc.)\n- Three modifiers + common key (Control+Alt+Shift+A, Mod+Alt+Shift+S, etc.)\n- Four modifiers + common key (Control+Alt+Shift+Meta+A, etc.)\n\n## Modifier Names\n\nUse canonical modifier names:\n- `Control` (not Ctrl) - The Control key\n- `Alt` (not Option) - The Alt key (Option on macOS)\n- `Meta` (not Command/Cmd) - The Meta/Command key (macOS only)\n- `Shift` - The Shift key\n\n## Platform-Adaptive `Mod` Modifier\n\nThe `Mod` modifier is a special platform-adaptive modifier that automatically resolves\nto the \"primary modifier\" on each platform:\n\n- **macOS**: `Mod` → `Meta` (Command key ⌘)\n- **Windows/Linux**: `Mod` → `Control` (Ctrl key)\n\nThis enables cross-platform hotkey definitions that work correctly on all platforms\nwithout platform-specific code. The `Mod` modifier is resolved at runtime based on\nthe detected platform.\n\n**When to use `Mod` vs platform-specific modifiers:**\n- Use `Mod` for cross-platform shortcuts (e.g., `Mod+S` for save)\n- Use `Meta` or `Control` when you need platform-specific behavior\n- Use `Mod` when you want your shortcuts to follow platform conventions automatically\n\n**Limitations:**\n- `Mod+Control` and `Mod+Meta` combinations are not allowed (they create duplicate\n  modifiers on one platform)\n- In four-modifier combinations, only canonical modifiers are allowed (no `Mod`)\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// Cross-platform shortcuts (recommended)\nconst save: Hotkey = 'Mod+S'           // Command+S on Mac, Ctrl+S on Windows/Linux\nconst saveAs: Hotkey = 'Mod+Shift+S'   // Command+Shift+S on Mac, Ctrl+Shift+S elsewhere\nconst comment: Hotkey = 'Mod+/'       // Command+/ on Mac, Ctrl+/ elsewhere\n\n// Platform-specific shortcuts\nconst macOnly: Hotkey = 'Meta+S'       // Command+S on Mac only\nconst windowsOnly: Hotkey = 'Control+S' // Ctrl+S on Windows/Linux only\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: Hotkey\ntitle: Hotkey\n---\n\n```ts\ntype Hotkey = \n  | Key\n  | SingleModifierHotkey\n  | TwoModifierHotkey\n  | ThreeModifierHotkey\n  | FourModifierHotkey;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:126](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L126)\n\nA type-safe hotkey string.\n\nProvides autocomplete for:\n- All single keys (letters, numbers, function keys, navigation, editing, punctuation)\n- Single modifier + common key (Control+S, Mod+A, Mod+/, etc.)\n- Two modifiers + common key (Mod+Shift+S, Control+Alt+A, etc.)\n- Three modifiers + common key (Control+Alt+Shift+A, Mod+Alt+Shift+S, etc.)\n- Four modifiers + common key (Control+Alt+Shift+Meta+A, etc.)\n\n## Modifier Names\n\nUse canonical modifier names:\n- `Control` (not Ctrl) - The Control key\n- `Alt` (not Option) - The Alt key (Option on macOS)\n- `Meta` (not Command/Cmd) - The Meta/Command key (macOS only)\n- `Shift` - The Shift key\n\n## Platform-Adaptive `Mod` Modifier\n\nThe `Mod` modifier is a special platform-adaptive modifier that automatically resolves\nto the \"primary modifier\" on each platform:\n\n- **macOS**: `Mod` → `Meta` (Command key ⌘)\n- **Windows/Linux**: `Mod` → `Control` (Ctrl key)\n\nThis enables cross-platform hotkey definitions that work correctly on all platforms\nwithout platform-specific code. The `Mod` modifier is resolved at runtime based on\nthe detected platform.\n\n**When to use `Mod` vs platform-specific modifiers:**\n- Use `Mod` for cross-platform shortcuts (e.g., `Mod+S` for save)\n- Use `Meta` or `Control` when you need platform-specific behavior\n- Use `Mod` when you want your shortcuts to follow platform conventions automatically\n\n**Limitations:**\n- `Mod+Control` and `Mod+Meta` combinations are not allowed (they create duplicate\n  modifiers on one platform)\n- In four-modifier combinations, only canonical modifiers are allowed (no `Mod`)\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// Cross-platform shortcuts (recommended)\nconst save: Hotkey = 'Mod+S'           // Command+S on Mac, Ctrl+S on Windows/Linux\nconst saveAs: Hotkey = 'Mod+Shift+S'   // Command+Shift+S on Mac, Ctrl+Shift+S elsewhere\nconst comment: Hotkey = 'Mod+/'       // Command+/ on Mac, Ctrl+/ elsewhere\n\n// Platform-specific shortcuts\nconst macOnly: Hotkey = 'Meta+S'       // Command+S on Mac only\nconst windowsOnly: Hotkey = 'Control+S' // Ctrl+S on Windows/Linux only\n```\n"}
